text:
Here's a simple HTML and JavaScript example to create a colorful website based on your mock-up. This code replaces the placeholder jokes with real ones:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Joke Website</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #8b4513;
        }
        .joke {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: #e0ffe0;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #696969;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>My Joke Website</h1>
        <div class="joke">
            <p>[Really funny joke 1]</p>
            <p class="reveal" id="joke1">Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="joke">
            <p>[Push #8 reveal punchline]</p>
            <p class="reveal" id="joke2">What do you call fake spaghetti? An impasta!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; OpenAI 2023</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
            const jokes = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");
            jokes.forEach(joke => {
                joke.style.display = "none";
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Joke Website</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #000;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .joke {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .reveal {
            display: none;
            color: #ff6347;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>My Joke Website</h1>
        <div class="joke">[Funny Joke]</div>
        <div class="reveal">[push to reveal punchline]</div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.querySelector('.reveal').addEventListener('click', function() {
            const jokeText = document.querySelector('.joke');
            jokeText.textContent = "Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything!";
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```
